# LIBRARY: own
# Where Link sees nothing but integers in an array, a function that calls itself guards its storage, whoever declares it: an array that arrives, and one that a variable of the module holds.
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: code f1:Body
# CHECK: IsPristine v0 builtinClass=Array
# CHECK: HasArrayStorage {{*}} arrayStorage=Int32
# CHECK: IsElementPresent {{*}} arrayStorage=Int32
# CHECK: GetArrayElement {{*}} arrayStorage=Int32 level=Proven [keyIsIntegral, isPresent]
# CHECK: GetArrayElement {{*}} mayHaveNumberNames
# RUN(ROOT): walk f2 mechanisms=all
# ROOT: code f2:Body
# ROOT: GetModuleVariable
# ROOT: HasArrayStorage {{*}} arrayStorage=Int32
# ROOT: IsElementPresent {{*}} arrayStorage=Int32
